# Optional: Steam Web API key for achievement progress + ownership checks.
# Without this, Trending/FreeDeals/local library still work, but Achievement Hunts
# and "Owned" badges on trending cards will not populate.
# Get a key at https://steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey
# You can also enter the key in the in-app Settings panel instead of using this env var.
STEAM_API_KEY=
